Modifications
-------------
This fork modifies the upstream code, starting from October 2025. Unless a file was
added here, every source file in app/src/main may have been modified; the commit
history of this repository is the authoritative record of what changed and when,
and it is published in full.

The functional changes are grouped as: sender grouping and grouped-sender
notifications, one time password detection with a keyword manager, search
highlighting, a colour customisation screen and launcher icon switching, an About
screen of this fork's own, and the rename of the app to IN Messages with its own
application id. The tests, CI workflows and build files were adjusted to match.

Source
------
The complete corresponding source for every published build is this repository:
<https://github.com/ls-lnb/IN-Messages>. Each release is built from a tagged commit
on the main branch by the workflow in .github/workflows/release-apk.yml; the README
explains how to build it.

Note on names and artwork
-------------------------
The launcher icon and graphics are the upstream Fossify artwork, kept here under the
same licence. "Fossify" and the Fossify logo are the Fossify project's identity; this
fork uses them descriptively, to say what it is built on, and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by Fossify.
